#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/newtype-pattern/parse-don-t-validate.md:6
msgid "Parse, Don't Validate"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/newtype-pattern/parse-don-t-validate.md:8
msgid "The newtype pattern can be leveraged to enforce _invariants_."
msgstr ""

